The file `data/test.json` is from the Hugging Face dataset
MBZUAI/OpenEarthAgent (revision f4d4e181ba2b3d2b2782c5799e8964906390e0f7)
and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. The dataset card
states that license. The full text is at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

`prompts/rs_agent_prompt.txt` and `prompts/answer_judge.txt` are the
evaluation protocol text from
https://github.com/mbzuai-oryx/OpenEarthAgent at revision
9229c53676a22a9232e49ba1d06cad41ca629f18. That repository has no LICENSE
file. They are included so the published step protocol and judge prompt
can be run. Copying them for this harness is authorized. See PORTING.md.

Tool-server implementation code from that repository is not committed in
this package. Cloning it for a run is authorized.
`scripts/setup_benchmark.py openearthagent` clones the pinned revision
into `data/openearthagent/upstream`, which is gitignored.
